of the Sea Dragon","overview":"Young Dee Renjie arrives in the empire's capital to join the Supreme Court as police judge of his region. He wants to become a prosecutor. Empress Wu, who is at the beginning of her reign, has commissioned the fierce detective Yuchi to investigate a sea monster that stalks the city at night and makes it unsafe."},{"language":"zh-CN","overview":"唐朝麟德年间，唐高宗与武则天强硬派出大军远征，谁知舰队在大海中遇袭，遭到重挫。该事件震惊洛阳，都城百姓狂热祭拜龙王，缭乱众生的“花魁”银睿姬更惹来各方势力觊觎。狄仁杰奉武后之命调查龙王一案，偏巧卷入绑架银睿姬的案件之中。在与劫匪搏杀过程中，狄仁杰遭遇亦敌亦友的大理寺卿尉迟真金，遂被对方投入大牢。银睿姬一案内龙王身影再现，使洛阳上空更添一道疑云。狱中狄仁杰凭借缜密推理博取回纥医工沙陀忠的信任，逃出大牢同查龙王真相。两起案件错综复杂，相互纠缠，引向全然未知的方向。"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[],"backdrops":[]},"poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bmvUrXkGV2nY3MFBihCsBmpyQO6.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dzu1V8vJmB3BPJS4nKrl8EdxpiB.jpg","seasons":[],"schema":{}}},"artworkLibrary":{"tmdb":{"schemaVersion":1,"source":"tmdb","id":217923,"type":"movie","originalLanguage":"zh-CN","series":{"poster":{"it":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bmvUrXkGV2nY3MFBihCsBmpyQO6.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bmvUrXkGV2nY3MFBihCsBmpyQO6.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bmvUrXkGV2nY3MFBihCsBmpyQO6.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bmvUrXkGV2nY3MFBihCsBmpyQO6.jpg","language":"it","width":800,"height":1200},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9MprbvvPlgXOlsd2L5iHrk374P7.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9MprbvvPlgXOlsd2L5iHrk374P7.jpg","language":"it","width":700,"height":1050}]},"en":{"status":"available","selected":{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/wsnioYKR2C2FlAYZxZTzihW2TVh.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/wsnioYKR2C2FlAYZxZTzihW2TVh.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},"candidates":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org